<h1 style="text-align: start; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="start"><strong>Tuttle Pool Closed Until Further Notice</strong></h1>
<p style="text-align: start; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="start">You are receiving this email because you have registered for an open swim time at Tuttle Pool the week of June 7. </p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Due to emergency maintenance, Tuttle Pool is closed until further notice. We hope to open later in the week, but aren't able to share an opening date at this time. We will keep everyone updated about opening. Visit <a href="https://www.columbus.gov/pools/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">columbus.gov/pools</a> for updates.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">We apologize for the inconvenience! You are welcome to sign up for an open swim block at any of our other pools - visit <a href="https://www.columbus.gov/pools/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">columbus.gov/pools</a> to sign up for another time slot.</p>
